continuation_asset_binding = "Attempt 2 stopped before the invariant assertions because the asset runtime omitted its required transfer-state table. The shared audit fixture now derives that table with lx_asset_transfer_state, binds it with the asset record and account registry, and registers and binds asset before escrow on initial creation and snapshot reopen; all invariant assertions remain intact."
